<title>PHILIPPINES: Bulletin says Q4 net 102.539 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Bulletin says Q4 net 102.539 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manila Bulletin Publishing Corp said on Friday it recorded net profit of 102.539 million pesos in the quarter ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The company, which publishes the Manila Bulletin newspaper, said in documents given to the Philippine Stock Exchange that revenues in the period were 616.036 million pesos.</p>
<p>It gave no comparative figures.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8914</p>
</text>
